  "notes": "Herdr fork preview (wwelder/herdr): feed cards with answers\n\nSource: 629923a5b613e44501c46e051a71940b8c45e731.\n\n- The feeds folder now holds JSON cards, not RSS: scripts write `~/.config/herdr/feeds/<source>/<id>.json`, and `feed.list` serves each card's text with the owner's answer beside it. RSS files are no longer read.\n- New `feed.act` API method: records the owner's answer to a card once (`<id>.reply.json`), refusing an action the card doesn't offer, text on a card without `input`, and an expired card. It then runs the source's `on-reply` handler (card path as argument, reply on stdin, 60 s); a handler that fails withdraws the answer. Guests and federation peers are denied.\n- Gram recaps keep up to 6000 characters (was 800); push bodies stay at 240.\n\nAll five assets were built by the manual Build artifacts workflow (run 42128627331).\n\nUpdate with `herdr update` on the preview channel.",
